THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
----------------------
Runtime and development dependencies are the property of their authors and remain
under their own licences (fastmcp, openai, google-api-python-client,
google-auth-oauthlib, pytest, pytest-cov, ruff, jsonschema, matplotlib -- see
README section 13.6 for the per-package list).

The official reference implementation of this game (Game-P2P-Cop-Chase,
(c) Dr. Yoram Segal / GTAI) is distributed under an Educational-Use EULA. Its wire
formats and protocol patterns were studied for interoperability and independently
re-implemented here; no code or asset from it was copied. The full accounting is in
docs/REUSE-REGISTER.md.

Match logs, configuration records and result reports committed under docs/evidence/
were produced jointly with the opposing teams named in each file and are published
here as evidence of play.

